section: compiler
synopsis: Add `-dep-json` output option to `ghc -M`
issues: #24384
mrs: !16717
description: {
    Adds the option to output the dependency information of `ghc -M` in
    JSON Lines format via the new flag `-dep-json <FILE>`.

    The output is richer than the `Makefile`, since it can encode additional information
    such as `quote` and `splice` imports (see `-XExplicitLevelImports`).
    By using JSON Lines, the output of `-dep-json` can be streamed efficiently.
}
